Title: A STUDY OF LIFE AND DEATH
Credit: written by
Author: Liam Dunstan



EXT. HOSPITAL - EARLY MORNING

Rain splatters on the outside of a hospital in the cluttered down-town area of a low decile South American city. An array of black security trucks sit at the base of the hospital, blocking the entrance.   

INT. MANUEL'S HOSPITAL ROOM - EARLY MORNING

A gloomy hospital room, the passed out body of MANUEL RUIZ, 20, lies on the room's sole bed. The outside city can be seen from the room's window. A figure, LIFE, stands meters from the foot of the bed.

LIFE, a being as old as time, presented in the body of a man in their early 30's, dressed in a pristine white suit. Stands contemplating the young man's fate. 

Behind LIFE, A second figure emerges from the darkness, DEATH.

Death, another immortal being, disguised as a woman in their late 30's, they're dressed in a black trench coat.
